    "detailed_description": "<strong>Description:</strong><br><br>Sail the seas as a pirate captain in this challenging roguelike action adventure game! Battle other pirates, search for booty, and upgrade your ship at ports. You can also find ship power-ups and encounter dangerous boss events and storm events.<br><br>Can you survive long enough to get a high position on the leaderboards and max out your world level? All exp gained will go towards raising the world level, which will make more interesting events occur and increase the amount of ship upgrades you can get, but beware as the world level increases not only you get the upgraded ships, so does the enemy pirates. The world level will increase how much score and exp you get to make up for the extra challenge and make it easier to position higher on the leaderboards.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>    \u2022 Weekly and All-time score leaderboards<br>    \u2022 Explore a vast procedurally generated world <br>    \u2022 Fight other pirates in ship-to-ship combat <br>    \u2022 Search for booty <br>    \u2022 Upgrade your ship with extra cannons and increase your ships size and destructive power<br>    \u2022 Find power-ups to give you an edge in battle such as, speed boosts, accuracy boosts, and shot velocity boosts<br>    \u2022 Go fishing and try catch all the fish for achievements<br>    \u2022 Manual aiming of cannon shots mechanics, so you have to estimate the flight time yourself and aim in front of other pirates accordingly<br><br><br><strong>Extra Notes:</strong><br><br>While we do have partial controller support via steam input and moving the mouse with the right control stick, the game was designed to be played with mouse and keyboard and the mouse makes it much easier to aim effectively.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Description:</strong><br><br>Sail the seas as a pirate captain in this challenging roguelike action adventure game! Battle other pirates, search for booty, and upgrade your ship at ports. You can also find ship power-ups and encounter dangerous boss events and storm events.<br><br>Can you survive long enough to get a high position on the leaderboards and max out your world level? All exp gained will go towards raising the world level, which will make more interesting events occur and increase the amount of ship upgrades you can get, but beware as the world level increases not only you get the upgraded ships, so does the enemy pirates. The world level will increase how much score and exp you get to make up for the extra challenge and make it easier to position higher on the leaderboards.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>    \u2022 Weekly and All-time score leaderboards<br>    \u2022 Explore a vast procedurally generated world <br>    \u2022 Fight other pirates in ship-to-ship combat <br>    \u2022 Search for booty <br>    \u2022 Upgrade your ship with extra cannons and increase your ships size and destructive power<br>    \u2022 Find power-ups to give you an edge in battle such as, speed boosts, accuracy boosts, and shot velocity boosts<br>    \u2022 Go fishing and try catch all the fish for achievements<br>    \u2022 Manual aiming of cannon shots mechanics, so you have to estimate the flight time yourself and aim in front of other pirates accordingly<br><br><br><strong>Extra Notes:</strong><br><br>While we do have partial controller support via steam input and moving the mouse with the right control stick, the game was designed to be played with mouse and keyboard and the mouse makes it much easier to aim effectively.",
